# Reachable, but answer 5xx often enough to fail a run at random even with
# retries (observed alternating 200/503 and 200/500 across probes). Listed so
# the checker stays trustworthy; the trade is that a real outage of these two
# would go unreported.
www\.redmine\.org/projects/redmine
code\.google\.com/p/promisedata/
